ill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" data-fpl-icon-size="16"><path fill="var(--fpl-icon-color, var(--color-icon))" d="M8 3a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v4h4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-4v4a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-4h-4a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h4v-4A.5.5 0 0 1 8 3"></path></svg></span></button></div><div data-testid="left-panel-body" class="xv9gime xdnwjd9 xh8yej3 x78zum5 xdt5ytf xozqiw3 xb3r6kr x1iyjqo2 xs83m0k x1t1x2f9 x4ax4og"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xh8yej3 x5yr21d"><div class="x1iyjqo2 xs83m0k x1t1x2f9"><div class="x1n2onr6 x78zum5 xdt5ytf xh8yej3 x5yr21d x9f619 x1lw1rap xnwblhb"><div class="x1n2onr6 xh8yej3 x5yr21d x78zum5 xdt5ytf"><div class="x1n2onr6 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x5yr21d xh8yej3" data-testid="code-chat-messages" data-fullscreen-prevent-event-capture="true" style="visibility: visible; --chat-container-height: 379.546875px;"><div class="x1n2onr6 xd0t9eb xpm7p51 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1iyjqo2 xs83m0k x1r8uery xb3r6kr x12nagc" data-fullscreen-no-mod-wheel-event-capture="false" data-fullscreen-wheel-event-capture="true" data-non-interactive="true"><div class="xh8yej3 x5yr21d xedcshv x1rife3k x6ikm8r x78zum5 x1q0g3np x1cy8zhl x1rohswg x8du1vd xfk6m8 xx69xxh" data-non-interactive="true"><div class="xh8yej3 x5yr21d x82snj4" data-non-interactive="true" style="--x-minHeight: 6660px;"><div class="x9f619 xh8yej3 xy2poyc xvueqy4 xz9dl7a xnjsko4" data-non-interactive="true"><div></div><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" style="height: 2524.03px; width: 100%; position: relative;"><div data-virtual-index="9:3-1791495271418" data-message-id="9:3-1791495271418" aria-hidden="false" style="visibility: visible;"><div data-chat-message-focus-target="" class="x10dr8xq x1hr3lfm x78zum5 xjl7jj xdt5ytf" tabindex="-1"><div role="region" aria-label="Prompt from Mohamed Cafe" class="xq1n1xh x1n2onr6"><div class="x78zum5 x1q0g3np x3pnbk8 xfex06f x13a6bvl" data-testid="user-chat-message"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf x3pnbk8 xfex06f xuk3077 x1n2onr6 xeuugli xv0phki"><div class="x1lliihq xgqmno8 x1m7iz9m xaope02 xho5uc7 x1hx0egp x13faqbe x1ed109x xeuugli x193iq5w x-default-marker xeaf4i8 x6lvhvz x1yrrw3v xxh3shw x2o3tdp x1m0tfim x1cr2j66 xiefpba x1k552vi"><div id=":r2b:" class="xjp7ctv"><div class="x1hx0egp x1ed109x"><p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Design a world-class creative AI application called FX — AI Creative Lab.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">FX is not a generic SaaS dashboard.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">It is a creative intelligence workspace for turning an initial creative brief into original ideas, strategic insights, concepts, and cinematic scripts.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">The product should feel like a hybrid between:</p>
<ul class="x1717udv x1ghz6dp x43c9pm xtaz4m5 x1aktaxo xzboxd6">
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">an elite creative agency</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">an AI creative director</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">a cinematic writers' room</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">an experimental design laboratory</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">a premium creative intelligence tool</li>
</ul>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Design the interface from the perspective of a senior product designer and creative director.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Core workflow</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Brief
→ Strategic Insight
→ Creative Concept
→ Cinematic Script</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">FX contains five lateral-thinking engines:</p>
<ol class="x1717udv x1ghz6dp x43c9pm x3yw8vx x1aktaxo xzboxd6">
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Provocation</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Analogies</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Random Stimulus</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Opposite Thinking</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Constraint Reversal</li>
</ol>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">The user should be able to understand this creative pipeline immediately.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Visual direction</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Do NOT create a generic AI dashboard.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Avoid the typical:</p>
<ul class="x1717udv x1ghz6dp x43c9pm xtaz4m5 x1aktaxo xzboxd6">
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">blue SaaS gradients</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">generic cards everywhere</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">excessive rounded rectangles</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">corporate enterprise aesthetics</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">template-looking layouts</li>
</ul>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Instead explore a distinctive editorial / cinematic / creative-lab visual language.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Think:</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">premium creative studio + modern AI interface + cinematic title sequence + experimental design system.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Use strong typography, sophisticated spacing, visual hierarchy, subtle motion, elegant transitions, and carefully controlled contrast.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">The interface should feel expensive, intelligent, artistic, and intentional.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Main experience</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Design:</p>
<ol class="x1717udv x1ghz6dp x43c9pm x3yw8vx x1aktaxo xzboxd6">
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Landing / Creative Lab home</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Brief workspace</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Thinking Engine selection</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Strategic Insight workspace</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Concept development workspace</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Cinematic Script workspace</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">Final creative output view</li>
</ol>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">The user should always understand:</p>
<ul class="x1717udv x1ghz6dp x43c9pm xtaz4m5 x1aktaxo xzboxd6">
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">where they are</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">what the AI is thinking about</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">what stage of the creative process they are in</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">what can be edited</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">what can be regenerated</li>
<li class="xvnky2a xup9fnv xzboxd6 x1xtb1vi xzlkgyw x22v61l x1i0w8z3">what the next creative action is</li>
</ul>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Important</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Create multiple visual directions before converging.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Explore at least 3 distinct art directions for FX.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Prioritize originality and creative quality over conventional SaaS patterns.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">The result should look like a product that could become the visual identity of a serious international creative AI company.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Desktop-first, responsive, Arabic + English, RTL-ready.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Design the actual product experience, not a marketing landing page.
Treat this as a real product design system, not a visual experiment.
Before implementation, explore 3 radically different visual directions for the complete FX product experience.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">For each direction, show the visual identity, layout philosophy, typography, navigation model, creative workspace structure, and cinematic script experience. Do not merely change colors — each direction should represent a genuinely different product design philosophy.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">After exploring the directions, recommend the strongest direction for FX and use it as the foundation for the final product experience.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Important: This is a design and product-experience exploration phase. Do not connect to or modify any backend, API, database, authentication, or existing FX code. Focus entirely on the product interface, interaction model, visual system, and creative workflow.</p></div></div><div class="x10l6tqk x19up5dg xq6397w x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x1sk9g4k x4qgb6o xhpnuu7 x1lruay5 x18w7dgx xrupv7f x1ypdohk xg01cxk x5b7970 x8w4yw4 x1bvilyr x1dquxsn xxmso5u x47corl x1r9kbfp x1mhnzaf x6o7n8i x13dflua x9lcvmn"><button data-fpl-component="" aria-label="Copy message" aria-describedby=":r2b:" type="button" tabindex="0" data-show-focus="true" class="_19xx72g0 button__button__-U-QJ button__ghost__0pJzW button__md__fgTCf button__hug__sHi7n"><span class="button__buttonContainer__C6lTN"><span class="button__buttonText__nvCyD"><span aria-hidden="true" class="button__icon__OodK0"><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-fpl-icon-size="24"><path fill="var(--fpl-icon-color, var(--color-icon))" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.5 6A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 6 7.5v6A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 7.5 15h6a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5v-6A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 13.5 6zM7 7.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v6a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-6a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zm2 9a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0 .5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h6a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-6a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5.5.5 0 0 1 0-1 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v6a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-6A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 9 16.5" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span><span class="button__buttonContent__tVdQi">Copy</span></span></span></button></div></div></div><div class="xpvyfi4 x1ty9z65" data-tooltip="Mohamed Cafe (you)" data-tooltip-type="text" data-tooltip-offset-y="4"><div><div class="x78zum5 xklk4pu x1jvydc1 xmaolms xtvhhri x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s x87ps6o xorixrz xb3r6kr x5lhr3w x16ye13r" style="--x-width: 24px; --x-height: 24px;"><img data-test-key="1791652055866-7rzi2ps" alt="" data-testid="image-avatar" class="x5lhr3w x16ye13r" src="https://s3-alpha.figma