<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Now I'm sketching ActionBar — a fixed bottom bar with translucent blur background, pulling stage labels from the translation object, and laying out back/regenerate/next controls in a flex row.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">Then I'm defining an Editable component that makes any tag content-editable, handling blur to commit text changes back via onChange.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">I still need a Glyph component for the ui, plus a Still.tsx component with a stylized SVG placeholder at a wide aspect ratio with gradient background.</p>
