<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">A "Lens" step sits between Brief and Insight in the top rail. A ribbon under the top bar shows the decisions so far. A bottom bar always shows where you are, what is editable, what can be regenerated, and the next action.</p>
<p class="xdj266r xvwc6ox x1xtb1vi x1j61x8r x17l0txs xzlkgyw x22v61l x1mzt3pk x1aktaxo xzboxd6">The EN / عربي toggle switches language and direction. Each language keeps its own session, so edits made in one language aren't carried into the other. All content is mock, and there is no backend, API or auth.</p></div></div><div data-fpl-component="primitive" aria-labelledby=":r2n:" role="group"><div data-fpl-component="primitive" class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xmkeg23 x1y0btm7 x844mss x127aom xb3r6kr" data-testid="assistant-code-diff-card"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 xmaolms x1h7iorg xrrek2q xah92qt xsqfnge xbxwrki xso031l x1q0q8m5 x1hxpj6c"><span id=":r2n:">Edited 14 files</span><span class="x78zum5 x1s58uyl x2lah0s x11t971q"><span class="xtsi7ac"><span aria-hidden="true">+2465</span></span><span class="x1dwu3tg"><span aria-hidden="true">-1</span></span><span class="_14wijgr0" data-fpl-sr-only="true">2,465 lines added, 1 line removed</span></span></div><ul class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xe8uvvx x1ghz6dp x1717udv" data-testid="assistant-code-diff-file-list"><li class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xso031l x1t1lzn6 x1q0q8m5 x1hxpj6c"><div class="x1n2onr6 xlk80a5 xn7s738 xnxuu4y x1a2a7pz xp6b5r4 xswve0s xt3l3uh x1j0wymg x1em0e x9lcvmn"><button data-fpl-component="primitive" aria-expanded="true" aria-label="Toggle diff for src/App.tsx" type="button" tabindex="0" data-show-focus="true" class="_19xx72g0 x10l6tqk x10a8y8t x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x13a6bvl x1fuw9x7 x1heor9g" aria-controls=":r2p:"><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="x1wt4b31" data-fpl-icon-size="24L"><path fill="var(--fpl-icon-color, var(--color-icon))" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.354 13.854a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0L12 10.207l-3.646 3.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708l4-4a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l4 4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><div class="x1n2onr6 x78zum5 x6s0dn4 xrrek2q xbxwrki x1lqv20w x1h7iorg x47corl x1jtduc"><button data-fpl-component="primitive" aria-label="Open src/App.tsx in the co