" data-fpl-sr-only="true">Added line 328: </span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">      </span><span style="color: rgb(9, 48, 119);">manifesto:</span></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="code-diff-line" class="x1n2onr6 xrvj5dj x1ppm182 xgqtt45 x5u4jae xmaolms x14wpwx4 x1cpjm7i x1hmns74 x1y3wzot xhq5o37 x1wlytlt x1n405n8 x1xh5bm8 xkk1bqk"><span class="x1fuw9x7 xp4054r x87ps6o xyy74w7 x32b0ac x11vh632 xtsi7ac" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="code-diff-line-number">329</span><span class="x1sdyfia xia6lk6"><span class="_14wijgr0" data-fpl-sr-only="true">Added line 329: </span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">        </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 62, 13);">'When the sun goes down over Riyadh, nobody goes home. The towers switch on, the streets fill, and the real work of the day (thinking, making, meeting) begins again. The Second Sunset is a film about that second light, and the cold brew that belongs to it.'</span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);">,</span></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="code-diff-line" class="x1n2onr6 xrvj5dj x1ppm182 xgqtt45 x5u4jae xmaolms x14wpwx4 x1cpjm7i x1hmns74 x1y3wzot xhq5o37 x1wlytlt x1n405n8 x1xh5bm8 xkk1bqk"><span class="x1fuw9x7 xp4054r x87ps6o xyy74w7 x32b0ac x11vh632 xtsi7ac" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="code-diff-line-number">330</span><span class="x1sdyfia xia6lk6"><span class="_14wijgr0" data-fpl-sr-only="true">Added line 330: </span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">    }</span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);">,</span></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="code-diff-line" class="x1n2onr6 xrvj5dj x1ppm182 xgqtt45 x5u4jae xmaolms x14wpwx4 x1cpjm7i x1hmns74 x1y3wzot xhq5o37 x1wlytlt x1n405n8 x1xh5bm8 xkk1bqk"><span class="x1fuw9x7 xp4054r x87ps6o xyy74w7 x32b0ac x11vh632 xtsi7ac" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="code-diff-line-number">331</span><span class="x1sdyfia xia6lk6"><span class="_14wijgr0" data-fpl-sr-only="true">Added line 331: </span><span 