<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" dir="ltr"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="cid:css-cc662388-02ad-4ac9-ad29-cae03cc041e1@mhtml.blink" />
    

    

    
    
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Figma Make App</title>
    
    <meta name="description" content="Transforms creative briefs into strategic insights, concepts, and cinematic scripts using innovative thinking engines for elite creative professionals.">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Figma Make App">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Transforms creative briefs into strategic insights, concepts, and cinematic scripts using innovative thinking engines for elite creative professionals.">
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <div id="root"><div style="background: rgb(10, 9, 8); color: rgb(237, 229, 214); font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, sans-serif;"><header class="flex h-16 items-center justify-between border-b px-6 lg:px-14" style="border-color: rgba(237, 229, 214, 0.18);"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3"><span class="text-[1.9rem] italic leading-none" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">FX</span><span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">Design exploration</span></div><button class="cursor-pointer text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] transition-colors hover:text-[#FF5A2A]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">Skip to the product →</button></header><section class="px-6 pb-20 pt-20 lg:px-14"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">Phase 01 · Three product philosophies</div><h1 class="mt-6 max-w-5xl text-[clamp(2.8rem,7vw,6.5rem)] font-light leading-[.95] tracking-[-0.03em]" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">Three ways to give a machine <em style="color: rgb(255, 90, 42);">a creative mind.</em></h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-[17px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">Same pipeline (Brief, Insight, Concept, Script), same five lateral-thinking engines. Three different answers to what the product is: a screening room, a lab notebook, a studio wall. Each is shown with its identity, layout, navigation, workspace and script experience.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-6" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(163, 155, 140);"><a href="https://ta-01m4kcb9evm0tbq1xq1w3w6r0s-1380-qil9fpp21nmtajwhlykxo2rrq.makeproxy-m.figma.site/#dir-A" class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] transition-colors hover:text-[#FF5A2A]">A · Title Sequence</a><a href="https://ta-01m4kcb9evm0tbq1xq1w3w6r0s-1380-qil9fpp21nmtajwhlykxo2rrq.makeproxy-m.figma.site/#dir-B" class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] transition-colors hover:text-[#FF5A2A]">B · The Specimen Sheet</a><a href="https://ta-01m4kcb9evm0tbq1xq1w3w6r0s-1380-qil9fpp21nmtajwhlykxo2rrq.makeproxy-m.figma.site/#dir-C" class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] transition-colors hover:text-[#FF5A2A]">C · The Atelier</a></div></section><section id="dir-A" class="px-6 py-20 lg:px-14" style="background: rgb(10, 9, 8); color: rgb(237, 229, 214); font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, sans-serif;"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">Direction A · Cinematic noir</div><h2 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5.5rem)] leading-[.95] tracking-[-0.025em]" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif; font-weight: 400; text-transform: none; font-style: italic;">Title Sequence</h2></div><div class="col-span-12 flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-5"><p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed">FX is a screening room. One stage fills the frame at a time, like chapters in a film. The AI is a director thinking out loud beside you.</p><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(163, 155, 140);"><b style="color: rgb(237, 229, 214);">Layout philosophy. </b>Asymmetric 3 / 9 grid. A narrow column holds the AI's reasoning; the wide column holds the work. Huge serif type, hairline rules, no cards.</p></div></div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(237, 229, 214, 0.18);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">Identity &amp; type</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex"><div class="h-10 flex-1