el</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="flex h-full gap-3 text-[9px]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;"><div class="flex w-[38%] flex-col gap-1 border-r pr-2" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11);"><div class="px-1 py-0.5">§1 BRIEF</div><div class="px-1 py-0.5">§2 LENS</div><div class="px-1 py-0.5" style="background: rgb(198, 255, 0); color: rgb(11, 11, 11);">§3 INSIGHT</div><div class="px-1 py-0.5">§4 CONCEPT</div><div class="px-1 py-0.5">§5 SCRIPT</div><div class="px-1 py-0.5">§6 OUTPUT</div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t pt-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11); outline: none;"><div style="width: 100%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.6;"></div><div style="width: 60%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.25;"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t pt-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11); outline: none;"><div style="width: 100%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.6;"></div><div style="width: 60%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.25;"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t pt-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11); outline: rgb(198, 255, 0) solid 2px;"><div style="width: 100%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.6;"></div><div style="width: 60%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.25;"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t pt-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11); outline: none;"><div style="width: 100%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.6;"></div><div style="width: 60%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.25;"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t pt-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11); outline: none;"><div style="width: 100%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.6;"></div><div style="width: 60%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.25;"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t pt-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11); outline: none;"><div style="width: 100%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.6;"></div><div style="width: 60%; height: 3px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.25;"></div></div></div></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 78);">A fixed left index (§1 to §6) over one long scrolling document. Stages are sections, not screens.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(85, 85, 78);">Workspace structure</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="flex h-full flex-col text-[9px]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-y-2 py-1 font-bold" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11);"><span>INPUT</span><span>OUTPUT</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b py-1.5" style="border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25); background: transparent;"><span style="opacity: 0.6;">coffee = mornings</span><span>→ coffee = evenings</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b py-1.5" style="border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25); background: transparent;"><span style="opacity: 0.6;">energy</span><span>→ permission</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b py-1.5" style="border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25); background: rgb(198, 255, 0);"><span style="opacity: 0.6;">bottle first</span><span>→ bottle last</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b py-1.5" style="border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25); background: transparent;"><span style="opacity: 0.6;">sells caffeine</span><span>→ sells time</span></div><div class="mt-auto flex gap-2 pt-2"><span class="px-2 py-1" style="background: rgb(11, 11, 11); color: rgb(241, 240, 234);">REGEN</span><span class="border px-2 py-1" style="border-color: rgb(11, 11, 11);">EDIT</span></div></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 78);">Input and output side by side as a ruled table. Changed rows are highlighted like a diff.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(85, 85, 78);">Cinematic script</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="h-full p-3 text-[9px] leading-[1.7]" style="background: rgb(11, 11, 11); color: rgb(237, 237, 230); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;"><div style="color: rgb(198, 255, 0);">$ fx script --route A --live</div><div class="flex gap-3"><span style="opacity: 0.5;">00:00</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 255, 0);">SC.01</span><span>EXT. RIYADH, DUSK</span></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span style="opacity: 0.5;">00:10</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 255, 0);">SC.02</span><span>INT. STUDIO, 7:42PM</span></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span style="opacity: 0.5;">00:22</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 255, 0);">SC.03</span><span>EXT. ROOFTOP, NIGHT</span></div><div class="caret mt-1">&gt; edit sc.02 vo</div></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 78);">A terminal log with timecode gutter and a live cursor. Powerful for editing, but cold for a creative audience.</p></div></div><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl border-t pt-4 text-[13px]" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 78); border-color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.25);"><b style="color: rgb(11, 11, 11);">Arabic &amp; RTL. </b>RTL: the index flips to the right and mono labels become Plex Arabic. Tabular logic survives well.</p></section><section id="dir-C" class="px-6 py-20 lg:px-14" style="background: rgb(235, 223, 203); color: rgb(42, 31, 22); font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif;"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Direction C · Warm spatial moodboard</div><h2 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5.5rem)] leading-[.95] tracking-[-0.025em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif; font-weight: 400; text-transform: none; font-style: normal;">The Atelier</h2></div><div class="col-span-12 flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-5"><p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed">FX is a studio wall. Thoughts are clippings you pin, group and connect. The AI is a collaborator who leaves notes in the margin.</p><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(110, 92, 73);"><b style="color: rgb(42, 31, 22);">Layout philosophy. </b>A freeform canvas. Rotated paper scraps, tape, dashed connectors, handwritten annotations. Tactile and human.</p></div></div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Identity &amp; type</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex"><div class="h-10 flex-1" style="background: rgb(235, 223, 203); border: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"></div><div class="h-10 flex-1" style="background: rgb(247, 239, 223); border: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"></div><div class="h-10 flex-1" style="background: rgb(42, 31, 22); border: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"></div><div class="h-10 flex-1" style="background: rgb(180, 80, 47); border: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"></div><div class="h-10 flex-1" style="background: rgb(107, 122, 69); border: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"></div></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1;">The hour after sunset</div><div dir="rtl" class="text-[22px]" style="font-family: Amiri, serif;">الساعة التي بعد الغروب</div><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Instrument Serif · Instrument Sans · Amiri</div></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Cream stock, ink brown, terracotta. A soft condensed serif, warm and approachable.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Navigation model</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="relative h-[200px]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif;"><div class="absolute grid size-[34%] place-items-center rounded-full border border-dashed" style="left: 4%; top: 8%; border-color: rgb(110, 92, 73);"><span class="text-[16px] italic" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Brief</span></div><div class="absolute grid size-[34%] place-items-center rounded-full border border-dashed" style="left: 38%; top: 44%; border-color: rgb(110, 92, 73);"><span class="text-[16px] italic" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Insight</span></div><div class="absolute grid size-[34%] place-items-center rounded-full border border-dashed" style="left: 64%; top: 6%; border-color: rgb(110, 92, 73);"><span class="text-[16px] italic" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Script</span></div><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 8%; top: 40%; width: 72px; transform: rotate(-4deg); background: rgb(247, 239, 223); color: rgb(42, 31, 22); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;">sold for mornings</div><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 44%; top: 30%; width: 76px; transform: rotate(3deg); background: rgb(180, 80, 47); color: rgb(247, 239, 223); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;">second sunrise</div><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 70%; top: 52%; width: 66px; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: rgb(247, 239, 223); color: rgb(42, 31, 22); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;">ice, macro</div></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Spatial zones for Brief, Insight and Script on a pannable canvas. Progress is a path, not a list.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Workspace structure</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="relative h-[200px]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif;"><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 2%; top: 6%; width: 110px; transform: rotate(-3deg); background: rgb(247, 239, 223); color: rgb(42, 31, 22); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;"><i class="text-[15px]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">The day changes light</i></div><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 48%; top: 2%; width: 90px; transform: rotate(4deg); background: rgb(180, 80, 47); color: rgb(247, 239, 223); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;">Insight 02</div><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 14%; top: 46%; width: 120px; transform: rotate(2deg); background: rgb(247, 239, 223); color: rgb(42, 31, 22); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;">Lighthouse for the night shift</div><div class="absolute px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] leading-tight" style="left: 58%; top: 52%; width: 84px; transform: rotate(-5deg); background: rgb(247, 239, 223); color: rgb(42, 31, 22); box-shadow: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.12) 2px 4px 0px;">what if no bottle?</div><svg class="absolute inset-0 size-full" fill="none" stroke="#B4502F" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3"><path d="M80 50C120 40 140 30 150 25M100 90C130 110 150 120 170 130"></path></svg></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Freeform board where each insight is a movable clipping. Delightful for ideation, hard to keep a clear stage.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border p-5" style="border-color: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">Cinematic script</div><div class="min-h-[190px] flex-1"><div class="grid h-full grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-[11px]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif;"><div class="col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;"><div class="text-[15px] italic">Scene 3, rooftop, night</div><div style="width: 100%; height: 4px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.5;"></div><div style="width: 90%; height: 4px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.5;"></div><div style="width: 70%; height: 4px; background: currentcolor; opacity: 0.3;"></div><div class="mt-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-1"><div class="aspect-video border" style="border-color: rgb(110, 92, 73); background: rgba(180, 80, 47, 0.15);"></div><div class="aspect-video border" style="border-color: rgb(110, 92, 73); background: rgba(180, 80, 47, 0.15);"></div><div class="aspect-video border" style="border-color: rgb(110, 92, 73); background: rgba(180, 80, 47, 0.15);"></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 pt-5" style="color: rgb(180, 80, 47);"><div class="-rotate-2 border-b border-dashed" style="border-color: rgb(180, 80, 47);">hold on the crack</div><div class="rotate-1 border-b border-dashed" style="border-color: rgb(180, 80, 47);">warmer here?</div></div></div></div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(110, 92, 73);">An annotated manuscript with margin notes and storyboard frames. Rich, but fragile for a timed 60-second script.</p></div></div><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl border-t pt-4 text-[13px]" style="color: rgb(110, 92, 73); border-color: rgba(42, 31, 22, 0.25);"><b style="color: rgb(42, 31, 22);">Arabic &amp; RTL. </b>RTL: the canvas flow reverses and notes move to the opposite margin. Handwriting-style notes would need a bespoke Arabic face.</p></section><section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-14"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.16em]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(255, 90, 42);">Recommendation</div><h2 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5.5rem)] font-light italic leading-[.95] tracking-[-0.03em]" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">Direction A, <br>Title Sequence.</h2><button class="mt-10 inline-flex h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 px-6 text-[14px] font-medium transition-colors hover:!bg-[#EDE5D6]" style="background: rgb(255, 90, 42); color: rgb(10, 9, 8);">Enter the FX Lab →</button></div><ol class="col-span-12 flex flex-col lg:col-span-6"><li class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t py-5 last:border-b" style="border-color: rgba(237, 229, 214, 0.18);"><span class="col-span-1 text-[11px]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(255, 90, 42);">01</span><div class="col-span-11"><div class="text-[1.4rem] leading-tight" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">The pipeline reads instantly.</div><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">A linear rail makes Brief to Insight to Concept to Script the visible spine. B hides it in a document; C turns it into a map.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t py-5 last:border-b" style="border-color: rgba(237, 229, 214, 0.18);"><span class="col-span-1 text-[11px]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(255, 90, 42);">02</span><div class="col-span-11"><div class="text-[1.4rem] leading-tight" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">It fits the output.</div><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">The end product is a film. A dark screening room with a paper script page makes the final stage feel like the destination.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t py-5 last:border-b" style="border-color: rgba(237, 229, 214, 0.18);"><span class="col-span-1 text-[11px]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(255, 90, 42);">03</span><div class="col-span-11"><div class="text-[1.4rem] leading-tight" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">It travels into Arabic.</div><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">A serif-led system pairs with Amiri without losing its voice, and the single-axis layout mirrors cleanly.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t py-5 last:border-b" style="border-color: rgba(237, 229, 214, 0.18);"><span class="col-span-1 text-[11px]" style="font-family: &quot;DM Mono&quot;, monospace; color: rgb(255, 90, 42);">04</span><div class="col-span-11"><div class="text-[1.4rem] leading-tight" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif;">It borrows the best of B and C.</div><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(163, 155, 140);">B's rigor becomes the status bar and visible reasoning trace. C's tactility becomes editable clippings and the paper script.</p></div></li></ol></div></section></div></div>
    
    
  

